# Environment of the open K1 bootloader (recipes-bsp/u-boot-k1): 32 KiB at
# byte 0x6A400 of the eMMC, inside the bootloader area before mmcblk0p1.
# With the stock bootloader this area is zero and fw_printenv reports a bad
# CRC; k1os-slot takes that as "no open bootloader" and skips the counter.
/dev/mmcblk0 0x6A400 0x8000
